{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Do not interpretations belong to Elohim?</b> Behold, the wisdom of dream-interpretation is in man by virtue of his being in the image of Elohim. Therefore it is possible that it may be in me as well, even though I am now a slave and in prison — and for this reason it may be that you were not correct in saying <b>and there is none that interprets it</b>."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 40, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:34:01.260846583Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}